      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seed Audio looks at the portrait and speaks **Line** in a voice that suits the host. A picture in `references` makes the node use omni dubbing, Seed Audio's way to voice a picture. Omni dubbing takes no `voice-name`, so `arguments` is empty (`{}`).\n\nTo choose the voice yourself, leave the portrait out and set `voice-name`, as **audio-01-voice-a-script** does."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
